..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : LJ.SET.DATE.PERIOD
.. Author         : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : tiwe
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Functionality  : Sets default date period.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
..  Set start date to 1st day one month ago
.assign M|adatum = F|fystartdate(F|getfy(G|datum), F|getfm(G|datum))
.assign M|adatum = M|adatum  - 1
.assign M|adatum = F|fystartdate(F|getfy(M|adatum), F|getfm(M|adatum))
.copy M|edatum = F|date('G|datum:8')
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
